{"id":"00935","root":"uni00935_1","name":{"ja":"九摩羅　ジュン","en":"Kumara Jun"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"九摩羅　ジュン","en":"Kumara Jun"},"element":"Science","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2025-09-16","limited":false,"characterId":999,"profile":{"ja":"軍略家を多数輩出する一族出身の対魔忍。\n目立った忍法は持たないが、対魔粒子の影響で神経が発達しており、優れた情報処理能力を持つ。ハッキング能力を活かした諜報活動によって味方を支える後方支援が得意。\n明るく社交的に振舞うが達観しており、プロファイリングと人間観察が好き。\n趣味が高じた結果、監視カメラを乗っ取って他人の私生活を覗き見する悪癖がある。\n本来運動神経は良いはずなのだが、身体を動かすのは嫌いなのでトレーニングはサボっており、持久力が無い上に慢性的な肩こり症に悩まされている。","en":"She is a Taimanin from a clan that has produced many strategists. She lacks any standout ninja techniques, but the influence of demonic particles has heightened her nerves, giving her superb information-processing abilities. She excels at rear-support, using her hacking skills for intelligence work to aid her allies. Bright and sociable yet detached, she enjoys profiling and people-watching. As a hobby she's developed a bad habit of hijacking surveillance cameras to peek into others' private lives. Though she should have good physical coordination, she hates moving her body, skips training, lacks stamina, and suffers from chronic shoulder stiffness."},"illustrator":"浜田遊歩","voiceActor":"小村スイ","forms":[{"id":"uni00935_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[886,1772],"sp":[190,190],"atk":[195,390],"def":[155,310],"spd":[45,45],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["5","2530149"]},{"id":"uni00935_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1272,2544],"sp":[260,260],"atk":[325,650],"def":[245,490],"spd":[45,45],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["5","2530149","2530150"]},{"id":"uni00935_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1658,3316],"sp":[380,380],"atk":[460,920],"def":[340,680],"spd":[45,45],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["5","2530149","2530150"]}],"skills":{"5":{"slot":"attack","id":5,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"deta